    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72988" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλῐγηπελ-έων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουσα</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπελάσας</span>), 
